      ro: ["Tunel subacvatic de 90 de metri", "Găzduiește rechini-taur de nisip", "Spectacole interactive de hrănire", "Accent pe conservarea marină"],
      en: ["90-meter underwater tunnel", "Features Sand Tiger Sharks", "Interactive feeding shows", "Focus on marine conservation"],
